cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "PLoRI — Per-pixel Local Rest-referenced Intensity"
abstract: >-
  A label-free method that extracts a cardiac contraction waveform and per-beat
  metrics directly from brightfield cardiac-organoid video. It stays robust to the
  drift and rotation of a free-floating organoid by referencing each pixel to its
  own recent resting level rather than to a single fixed frame.
